Modifications made in this repository relative to upstream TFLOP:
  - Added the Geometry-Aware Pointer (GAP) loss
    (tflop/model/decoder/mbart_decoder_weighted.py) and its integration
    into the pointer loss path (tflop/model/decoder/mbart_decoder.py).
  - Added GAP configuration keys to config/exp_configs/general_exp.yaml.
  - Removed experiment/analysis scripts not required for training or
    inference.
